{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"kat-dennings","name":"Kat Dennings","birthDate":"1986-06-13","birthPlace":"Bryn Mawr, Pennsylvania, USA","bio":"Katherine Victoria Litwack (born June 13, 1986), known professionally as Kat Dennings, is an American actress. She is known for her starring roles as Max Black in the CBS sitcom 2 Broke Girls (2011–2017) and as Darcy Lewis in the Marvel Cinematic Universe superhero films Thor (2011), Thor: The Dark World (2013), Thor: Love and Thunder (2022), and the Disney+ miniseries WandaVision (2021).\n\nSince making her acting debut in 2000, Dennings has appeared in films including The 40-Year-Old Virgin (2005), Big Momma's House 2 (2006), Charlie Bartlett (2007), The House Bunny (2008), Nick and Norah's Infinite Playlist (2008), Shorts (2009), Defendor (2009), and Suburban Gothic (2014).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kat Dennings, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:32:58+00:00","tmdbId":52852,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/52852","credits":[{"id":"thor","title":"Thor","character":"Darcy Lewis"},{"id":"thor-dark","title":"Thor: The Dark World","character":"Darcy Lewis"},{"id":"thor-love","title":"Thor: Love and Thunder","character":"Darcy"},{"id":"wandavision","title":"WandaVision","character":"Darcy Lewis / The Escape Artist"},{"id":"whatif-2","title":"What If...? — Season 2","character":"Darcy Lewis"},{"id":"whatif-3","title":"What If...? — Season 3","character":"Darcy Lewis"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/kat-dennings.webp","filmography":[{"name":"A Very Mythical Holiday Special","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2GAp8uwDyJGvMJSyI5xkLd8C2Ja.jpg"},{"name":"Shifting Gears","year":2025,"character":"Riley Parker","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tZnI8fWCtmJ9doCYSJwoJBITBiV.jpg"},{"name":"Hollywood Squares","year":2025,"character":"Self","mediaType"